From a0c617870c811238822d27f19e300fab97c171a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Cochran <40193276+kevincloud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:00:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add an express boarding lane and a lanes endpoint for gate
 operations

Passengers with no checked bags board through an express lane at every gate,
which seats them in roughly half the time and shortens the zone queue for
everyone else. Per-lane boarding counts and average gate-to-seat time are
exposed at GET /api/lanes and shown on the deck's instruments panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
